===== sruman profiles --help
Manage profiles

Usage: sruman profiles [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list        List profiles, implicit ones included
  show        Show a profile: runtime build, mode, prefix and who shares it
  new         Create a profile, then its prefix
  edit        Edit a profile in $EDITOR, then check it
  edit-games  Edit games.toml in $EDITOR, then check it
  delete      Delete profiles
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -y, --yes
          Answer every prompt with its default

      --color <WHEN>
          Colorize the output
          
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

  -q, --quiet
          Less output (`runtimes`: names only)

  -v, --verbose...
          Log to stderr (-vv: more)

      --config <FILE>
          Use this config.toml

  -h, --help
          Print help

