===== sruman profiles new --help
Create a profile, then its prefix

Usage: sruman profiles new [OPTIONS] --runtime <RUNTIME> <PROFILE>

Arguments:
  <PROFILE>
          

Options:
  -r, --runtime <RUNTIME>
          Its runtime: `sniper` or `sniper=<build>`

  -y, --yes
          Answer every prompt with its default

      --color <WHEN>
          Colorize the output
          
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

      --mode <MODE>
          Where its libraries come from
          
          [default: container]
          [possible values: container, overlay]

      --prefix <DIR>
          Its prefix directory [default: prefix_root/PROFILE]

  -q, --quiet
          Less output (`runtimes`: names only)

  -v, --verbose...
          Log to stderr (-vv: more)

      --config <FILE>
          Use this config.toml

  -h, --help
          Print help

